    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Yosefu wagu'gwi'laga muv'i'li' gwamwa ise, wamuli'laga na ku'musu'na ha wu'syu'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Yosefu wav'alagi'li'zyaga v'ambeza v'akwe, v'agu'v'ile muv'i'li' gwamwa ise wu'ganga ki'gele gu'leke ku'wola. Nav'o v'av'ezyaga vyeni'vyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muli'mo gwenu'go gwasolaga nsiku' maku'mi ane, ku'nguno hu' itungo i'lo ndi' li'li'koov'iwa lya ku'v'ila wu'ganga. V'amisili nav'o v'amuli'laga Yakobo ku' nsiku' maku'mi mupungati'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nsiku' zya ku'muli'la aho zyamala, Yosefu wav'awi'laga v'ayangu' v'amwa Falao ati', “U'lu' napandi'kaga wu'soga ha mbele yinywe, nu'mulomba musu'nsu'mu'le na Falao, mumuwi'le ati', v'av'a wanne ndi' wandahi'li'zya na ku'yomba ati', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Ene negelaga ku'fwa. U'lu' nafwa, u'kanzyi'ki'le ku' ki'v'i'mbi' i'cho nasi'mbile ku' nsi' ya Kanaani.’ Gi'si' nu'mulomba Falao anzumi'zye nje nkamuzyi'ke v'av'a wanne hangi' ndasu'v'e.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Falao wasu'v'yaga ati', “Yaga u'kamuzyi'ke so ki'ti' i'vyo waku'lahi'li'zya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene, Yosefu wayaga ku'kamuzyi'ka ise. V'awu'kaga haki'mo na v'atu'mami v'ose v'amwa Falao, v'anamala v'a mu lu'go lwamwa Falao, na v'anamala v'ose v'a mu nsi' ya Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' wawu'kaga na v'antu' v'ose v'a ha lu'go lwakwe, v'adu'gu'ye, haki'mo na v'antu' v'a lu'go lwamwa ise. V'ana v'ado v'ado na mitugo du' hu' i'zyo zyasigalaga ku' lwandi' lwa Gosheni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' v'awu'kaga na v'aliina falasi na mikokoteni zya ku'kweswa na falasi. Nalyo lyav'aga idale ihanya muno lya v'antu'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho v'afikaga ha lwandi' lwa Atadi ha lu'mbu'ga, bi'hi' na ngu'ka ya mongo gwa Yolodani, v'ali'laga ku' misayo mihanya. Yosefu wikalaga kwenu'ko ku' nsiku' mupungati' ku'muli'la ise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'akanaani av'o v'av'age v'ikazi v'a henanho, aho v'awonaga v'antu' v'ali'li'la ha lwandi' lwa lu'mbu'ga lwa ha Atadi, v'ayombaga ati', “Ki'li'lo cha V'amisili ki'li' ki'hanya muno!” Ku'nguno yeni'yo, henanho hitanagwa Abeli-misili",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "“Abeli-misili” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “ku'li'la kwa Misili.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", na henanho hu' yi'li' ngu'ka ya mongo gwa Yolodani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'ana v'akwe v'amuv'ezezyaga sav'o Yakobo ki'ti' i'vyo ndi' walagi'li'zya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'agu'filaga muv'i'li' ku' nsi' ya Kanaani, na ku'muzyi'ki'la mu ipilinga ha ilale i'lo lyav'age ku' Makipela, bi'hi' na Mamule. Ilale lyeni'lo hu' i'lo ndi' wagu'la Abalahamu ku'mwa Efuloni, Muhiti, ki'gele hav'e ha ku'zyi'ki'la v'antu' v'akwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Yosefu wamali'laga ku'muzyi'ka ise, wasu'v'aga ku' Misili haki'mo na v'adu'gu'ye, na v'antu' v'ose av'o ndi' v'amufili'li'zya ku'kamuzyi'ka ise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yosefu ali'v'asini'zya hi'mba v'adu'gu'ye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yav'aga aho ki'li'lo chamwa sav'o chamalaga, v'adu'gu' v'amwa Yosefu v'ayombaga ati', “Yi'ku'v'a vihe Yosefu u'lu' atu'u'le nsika na ku'ku'li'pi'ki'zya mav'i gose ago ndi' kwamuv'ezezya?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho v'amutu'mi'laga nkombe Yosefu ku'yomba ati', “Aho so akaali' ku'gulala ndi' walagi'li'zya i'vi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Muwi'li Yosefu ati', “Nu'ku'lomba u'v'atondole v'adu'gu'yo ku' wu'kenagu'zi wav'o na magambo mav'i gose ago v'aku'v'ezezya.”’ Gi'si' ku'li'ku'lomba u'ku'tondole, iswe v'akumba v'amwa Mulungu wamwa so.” Yosefu wali'laga aho wigwa mihayo zyeni'zi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho v'adu'gu'ye v'izaga na ku'muku'v'i'i'la ku' wov'a na ku'yomba, “Lingaga, iswe ku'li' v'asese v'ako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi Yosefu wav'awi'laga ati', “Ku'du' mogohe. Ene nkav'ile Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inywe ndi' muli' na ndaka ya ku'nvulazya, ali'vi Mulungu ndi' ali' na ndaka nsoga, ki'gele li'gelani'le i'li' li'li'v'ezyeka gi'si', ku'v'akomola v'antu' v'ingi ki'gele v'av'e na wu'panga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'nguno yeni'yo ku'du' mogohe. Ene nku'musu'nga inywe haki'mo na v'ana v'inywe.” Haho wasu'nsu'mu'laga nav'o visoga na ku'zitunia myoyo zyav'o.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ku'fwa kwamwa Yosefu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I'vi hu' vyene Yosefu wikalaga ku' nsi' ya Misili, mweni'ki'li' haki'mo na igongo lyose lyamwa ise. Wikalaga mu welelo ku' itungo lya myaka igana li'mo na iku'mi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.22",
