              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefu wapandi'kaga lu'v'ango lwa ku'v'awona v'ana v'amwa Ifulaimu, ninga wu'v'yalwa wakwe wa wu'datu'. Hangi' wav'awonaga v'ana v'amwa Makili, mwana wamwa Manase, nawe wav'azumyaga v'av'e ki'ti' v'ana v'akwe.",
          "type": "text",
