              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Yosefu wav'alahi'li'zyaga v'ana v'amwa Izilaeli na ku'yomba ati', “Mulungu aho alamwizi'i'le ku'mugwasya, ku'du' mwize muleke maguha ganne henanha.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
